  Original License: Apache-2.0 AND GPL-3.0-only
  Original Authors: Parity Technologies (UK) Ltd.

================================================================================
SIGNIFICANT CHANGES
================================================================================

The following significant modifications have been made to the original work:

1. PROJECT RENAME AND REBRAND
   - Project renamed from "Polkadot SDK" to "Pezkuwi SDK"
   - Maintainer references (repository URLs, contact addresses) point to
     Dijital Kurdistan Tech Institute; Parity Technologies (UK) Ltd. copyright
     notices in source file headers and crate authors are retained
   - All crate prefixes updated (sp- -> pezsp-, sc- -> pezsc-, frame- -> pezframe-,
     pallet- -> pezpallet-, cumulus- -> pezcumulus-)
   - Core framework renamed from "Substrate" to "Bizinikiwi"
   - Parachain infrastructure renamed from "Cumulus" to "PezCumulus"

2. NETWORK CONFIGURATION
   - Relay chain network renamed to "Pezkuwi" (was "Polkadot")
   - Test networks renamed: Westend -> Zagros, Rococo -> Pezkuwichain
   - Native token: HEZ (relay chain), PEZ (Asset Hub)
   - Genesis configuration updated for Dijital Kurdistan Tech Institute deployment

3. CUSTOM PALLETS ADDED (original work of Dijital Kurdistan Tech Institute)
   - pezpallet-identity-kyc: identity and KYC management
   - pezpallet-messaging: ephemeral encrypted peer-to-peer messaging
   - pezpallet-perwerde: education management
   - pezpallet-pez-rewards: trust-score-based rewards distribution
   - pezpallet-pez-treasury: programmatic treasury with synthetic halving
   - pezpallet-referral: referral management
   - pezpallet-staking-score: staking score calculation
   - pezpallet-tiki: role NFT management
   - pezpallet-token-wrapper: wrapping native HEZ into the wHEZ asset
   - pezpallet-trust: trust score engine
   - pezpallet-welati: governance and state administration
   - pezpallet-tnpos: trust-enhanced nominated proof-of-stake committee selection
   The governance origins and tracks of the Asset Hub and People runtimes are
   adapted from the Asset Hub Westend runtime of Polkadot SDK.

4. INFRASTRUCTURE
   - CI/CD pipeline adapted for self-hosted runners
   - Build system updated for independent deployment

